error[L0404]: `(vec i64)` does not implement `joinable`
 --> check/join_items_not_text.knv:2:18
  |
2 |   (println (join (vec 1 2) ",")))
  |                  ^^^^^^^^^ this needs `joinable`
  |
  = note: `joinable` is implemented for `(vec item)` for each `item` in: string, (ref str)
  = note: `joinable` is implemented for `(slice item)` for each `item` in: string, (ref str)
  = help: `join` takes a vector or a slice of `string` or `(ref str)` items: turn other items into text first, as in `(join (collect (map (iter items) str)) ", ")`, and collect an iterator, as in `(join (collect items) ", ")`; both allocate the vector
